{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42387","headline":"题梁王旧园 · 徐铉","name":"题梁王旧园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁王旧馆枕潮沟，共引垂藤系小舟。\n树倚荒台风淅淅，草埋欹石[雨]修修。\n门前不见邹枚醉，池上时闻鴈鹜愁。\n节士逢秋多感激，不须频向此中游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}